\f1\fs22 Hayley anticipated her second encounter with Stasis Anomalies Investigator Chip Stockwell would be much more rewarding. Eloise\'92s lawyers had contacted Fridge Force to negotiate a settlement of certain matters regarding a malfunctioning stasis unit on Shakti Enterprises corporate property, and since this was a matter for corporate law which, in Ulyssia, tipped the scales being held by the blind bitch called Impartiality very much in favour of corporations, said lawyers respectfully enquired whether some civilised settlement of the matter could be agreed to before someone felt compelled to pull a trigger or push a button of some kind or another.\
Fridge Force agreed to negotiations, provided Eloise attended.\
Eloise agreed to attend, provided negotiations were \'91discreetly\'92 conducted in public, and provided Stasis Anomalies Investigator Chip Stockwell attended. And was the only Fridge Force attendee.\

\f2\i Fine
\f1\i0 , said Fridge Force, 
\f2\i as long as Eloise was the sole attendee for Shakti Enterprises.
